# Case output and evidence never go into the image: the dev stack mounts this folder as the
# backend's /app, so a relative output path lands here (a whole E01 case once did)
*.E01
*.e01
*.Ex01
*.mem
*.raw
*.dd
*.vmdk
*.pst
**/artefacts/
